Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a different single model to see if any other top performer beats CWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_catboost"}

