Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test another single strong model to see if it beats CWT_rf, e.g., DWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"DWT_rf"}

