Action: evaluate_strategy  

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a deterministic bootstrap aggregation (dba) on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if it can beat the best single model.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse-error weights to see if a data‑driven weighting improves over the best single model.  

Action: evaluate_strategy  

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","DWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if a non-robust average improves over the weighted inverse-error w2.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

